OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSouthern England starts the day
OL,6,Fcloudy with patchy drizzle. Elsewhere,
OL,7,Flargely dry with sunny spells. Later,
OL,8,Frain spreads into Northern Ireland,
OL,9,Fsouthern Scotland and northern
OL,10,FEngland, with blustery showers and
OL,11,Fpossible thunderstorms in northwest
OL,12,FScotland. Very warm southeast, average
OL,13,Felsewhere.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTonight:FHeavy rain continues to
OL,16,Faffect central areas before slowly
OL,17,Fshifting towards the southeast later.
OL,18,FClearer spells developing in the north
OL,19,Fwith blustery showers for much of
OL,20,Fwestern Scotland. Mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
