OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRain clears the southeast
OL,6,Fthrough the morning, leaving a mostly
OL,7,Fdry day with bright spells. Blustery
OL,8,Fshowers affect northern areas, easing
OL,9,Flater. Strong winds in the north.
OL,10,FTemperatures near normal.
